Description: All your laptop battery information in one place, for GNOME
 Battery Health Center shows everything about your laptop battery in one GNOME
 app: health and cycle count, charge limits to reduce wear, charge to 100% once,
 battery use during sleep, power modes and power-saving settings, and which apps
 use the most energy.
 .
 Charge limits need a laptop whose firmware exposes charge thresholds to the
 kernel (as on ThinkPads and many others). Changing them asks for your password
 through PolicyKit.

